    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but i'm so far from anyone. even if i could reach them, what's the point? everything is just broken. it feels like the world is telling me it's okay to just... stop. like maybe it's actually more natural to just let the darkness win than to keep dragging this broken body through the snow. don't you think at some point, letting go is just the most logical thing left to do?",
